\par\par \b \uc2 Israel cenbank can't buy  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  forever -Fischer\b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 2009\par 13:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 JERUSALEM, Aug 5 (Reuters) - Bank of Israel Governor Stanley Fischer on Wednesday defended a plan of buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but said the purchases could not be sustained in the long term since the market is ultimately stronger.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Israel for more than a year has been buying $100 million a day of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a dual goal of boosting \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves while trying to prevent an appreciation of the shekel <ILS=>, which would make exports less attractive.\par \par \uc2 "I sleep much better at night ... But it's clear, we cannot continue buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  forever," Fischer told parliament's finance committee. "Everyone understands that in the long run, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cannot stand up to the market and win."\par \par \uc2 Reserves rose $2.1 billion in July to a record $52.1 billion from $32.5 billion a year ago.\par \par \uc2 On the heels of a 12 percent gain in the shekel against the dollar to match a Dec. 19 peak of 3.74 per dollar, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it would expand its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market and buy more than $100 million a day "in the event of unusual movements in the exchange rate". [ID:nL379377]\par \par \uc2 Dealers have reported the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought hundreds of millions of dollars the past few sessions, weakening the shekel to as much as 3.96 early on Wednesday before recovering to 3.89. (Reporting by Steven Scheer; Editing by Andy Bruce)\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 /FISCHER|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|MD|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090805e585000xr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
