\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervenes \highlight\uc2 , says buys  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 336 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2008\par 16:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds estimate of how much \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought)   \par \par \uc2 TEL AVIV, March 13 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the shekel market for the first time in more than a decade, buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in light of the "unusual behaviour of the shekel in recent days".   \par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokeswoman said it would not provide any further information.   \par \par \uc2 A dealer at an Israeli bank, who declined to be named, estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $200 million worth of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in two waves.   \par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said the last time the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market was in 1997.   \par \par \uc2 The shekel's <ILS=> official rate advanced 2.3 percent to 3.4030 against the dollar on Thursday, its largest one-day appreciation since October 23, 1998.   \par \par \uc2 It then advanced further, reaching 3.35 against the dollar as rating agency  \uc2 Moody's\uc2  said it was placing Israel's A2 government bond ratings and A2 country ceiling on review for possible upgrade.   \par \par \uc2 However, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the shekel fell back to around 3.44 per dollar.   \par \par \uc2 Bank of Israel Governor Stanley Fischer has in the past rejected calls for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, saying he prefers to let market forces prevail.   \par \par \uc2 Over the past four sessions the shekel has advanced by nearly 6 percent against the globally weak U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . So far in 2008 the shekel has gained 13 percent on top of an 11 percent appreciation in 2007, making it one of the best performing emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Last month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  lowered its key lending rate by a surprise half point to 3.75 percent, partly in an attempt to cool the shekel's rally that was hurting exporters and threatening future economic growth. (Reporting by Tova Cohen and Steven Scheer; Editing by Ron Askew)   \par \par \uc2 SHEKEL-CENBANK/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|MD|BNX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080313e43d001br\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
