\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2  head rules out  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Januar 2002\par 12:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Jan 3 (Reuters) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor David Klein said on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market despite the shekel's weakening of 4.6 percent in the past two weeks to a record low against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Klein said there was no danger of prices rising due to the shekel's weakness since the economy was in a recession. \par \par \uc2  "There is no reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," Klein told reporters at a business conference. \par \par \uc2  "We do not have an exchange rate target so we do not have any red lines that we cannot cross," he said. \par \par \uc2  "There is no need to prevent the market doing what it wants to do. The shekel's fall is a natural response to the current situation." \par \par \uc2  The shekel fell to 4.48 against the dollar on Thursday afternoon from 4.27 just before Klein slashed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's key lending rate on December 23 by two percentage points to an historic low of 3.8 percent. \par \par \uc2  Klein said the danger of a rise in inflation in January was "less of a concern" than the consumer price index for 2002 as a whole. \par \par \uc2  "It's always possible that the 2002 inflation rate will be higher than the government target (2-3 percent) but it's too early to say there is a danger," Klein said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020103dy1300ls3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\