\par\par \b \uc2  Business News From The Israeli Press Sunday \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 2000\par 10:14\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry is weighing a new solution to its dispute with the Bank of Israel over eliminating the shekel trading band, Yediot Ahronot reported. The ministry, which is blocking the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's push to jettison the band, wants to get rid of the band's floor and keep only a fixed ceiling of ILS3.88 to the dollar. It figures a floor is unnecessary because the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading if the shekel drops sharply, in order to prevent inflation from rising above the government's target, the newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  Communications Minister Binyamin Ben-Eliezer has promised to give state-run Bezeq, The Israel Telecommunication Corp. (C.BZQ) a license for high-speed Internet access shortly after the entire communications market is opened to competition, Ha'aretz reported. The idea is opposed by those who say that will give Bezeq a leg up on potential competitors in that space. Cable companies currently can't get a license to offer high-speed Internet access. \par \par \uc2  The details of 2001 budget cuts and additions are to be decided Sunday, Maariv reported. Infrastructure expenditures are expected to rise. The Finance Ministry has proposed a 3.2-billion-shekel ($1ILS4.0120) budget cut, but Barak is said to oppose a proposed ILS600 million defense-expenditures cut. \par \par \uc2  Bigband Networks, a developer of technology that transmits video, text, voice and data over and to various infrastructures, has raised $30 million in private equity, Maariv reported. \par \par \uc2  82026 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010805dw93002yh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
