t is "very high." \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1148GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duc301ogf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
