\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2 's Frenkel: Ctrl Bk Didn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 November 1998\par 10:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel Wednesday defended his decision not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, preferring to raise domestic interest rates to tame an inflationary upsurge. \par \par \uc2  "What I can say after the fact is that we didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 " in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade, Frenkel said of the period in which the shekel ($1=ILS4.1630) lost more than 11% of its value against the dollar in early October. \par \par \uc2  The shekel's swift decline has doubled inflation estimates for 1998 to as high as 10% and called into question the government's ability to meet its 1999 target of 4.0% inflation. The government inflation target for 1998 is 7.0% to 10%. \par \par \uc2  Some foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  once or twice, selling dollars on the market in early October, but didn't choose to make it public. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel stressed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's view of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was pragmatic, not dogmatic. \par \par \uc2  "If I reach the conclusion with my colleagues that (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will be effective it will be done," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, he and Finance Minister Yaakov Neeman decided against \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in shekel trading, even during the most dramatic shekel declines in early October, to prevent a possible speculative attack on the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel made the remarks Wednesday at a Knesset Finance Committee meeting and was subject to harsh criticism by lawmakers on his policy moves. The Knesset committee was to discuss a bill that calls for diluting Frenkel's sole authority to set interest rates and advocates reinforcing the powers of an advisory council on monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 25-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0944GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dubp01ih8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
