\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2 's Frenkel: No Dogmatic View On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 128 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 November 1998\par 18:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Tel Aviv (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel Monday left open the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't have a "dogmatic view against \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Frenkel said. At the same time, he said, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't support regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in financial markets which leads to the reduction of risk. \par \par \uc2  The Shekel (ILS) has lost more than 12% of its value against the dollar since the end of September. \par \par \uc2  Despite calls in October for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the wave of dollar buying, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't known to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Israeli market during that time. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 09-11-98 \par \par \uc2  1723GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dub900xcm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
