\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Israel \highlight\uc2 's Frenkel: No Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 327 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 1998\par 15:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Jacob Frenkel said Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as the shekel (ILS) continued its decline against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  and, from a strategic standpoint, isn't interested in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Frenkel told reporters in Jerusalem. \par \par \uc2  "We must realize that the volatility in the Israeli foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market reflects the volatility in the world," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts also said that an interest rate increase would be insufficient to stem the depreciation. \par \par \uc2  At 1253 GMT, the shekel was trading at ILS4.3500 to the dollar, 0.8% down from Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixing at ILS4.3160. Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen in the market. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel said the Bank of Israel would use the policy tools at its disposal "to prevent an inflationary spiral." \par \par \uc2  The shekel's depreciation of some 12% since the end of September alone has inflated prices and fueled expectations of a consumer price index rise of more than 2.5% in October alone. Inflation in annualized terms through the end of August was estimated between 4.0% to 5.0%. \par \par \uc2  "The October consumer price index will be high - it reflects the rise in the exchange rate," Frenkel said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise the 9.5% discount rate in November to curb the inflationary upsurge by as much as 150 basis points. The Bank of Israel is scheduled to announce the November lending rate on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Frenkel wouldn't confirm an interest rate rise, but said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would act to make sure the inflated CPI increases (didn't) won't lead to higher inflation for 1999. The government's inflation target for next year is 4.0%. \par \par \uc2  -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1333GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dual00bi3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
