\par\par \b \uc2  Israel Shekel Dn Vs Dlr Early; Trading At ILS4.3250 \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 1998\par 11:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The shekel (ILS) is trading lower against the dollar early Wednesday, with a steeper slide at the market's open offset by selling from business sector customers. \par \par \uc2  The shekel fell to ILS4.4200 against the dollar at the market's open, then strengthened to ILS4.3200 with dollar sales from business sector customers. Trading was light and volumes were thin, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0920 GMT, the shekel was trading close to ILS4.3250 to the dollar, a weakening of 0.2% compared to Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixing of ILS4.3160. \par \par \uc2  "The risk is still towards depreciation," said one dealer. "But I don't think the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the shekel hits a level of ILS4.5 to ILS4.6," closer to the lower limit of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band. \par \par \uc2  The band allows the Israeli \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade 15% on either side of a gradually depreciating midpoint. At 0920 GMT, the shekel was about 10% away from its lower limit. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Israel Governor Jacob Frenkel has maintained the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market unless the shekel's trading band is threatened. Finance Minister Yaakov Neeman reiterated the position Tuesday, noting that governments who tried to control the exchange rate via \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  were hit hard in the end. \par \par \uc2  -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0949GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dual00b7k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
