osed of the dollar, mark, pound sterling, French franc and yen, was fixed at 4.7653 shekels against 4.6887 shekels on Monday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the shekel traded at 3.6895 shekels per 100 yen compared with 3.7024 on Monday, and against the mark at 2.6440 shekels compared with 2.6112 shekels on Monday. \par \par \uc2  ((Tel Aviv newsroom, +972 3 537-2211 x238, telaviv.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113duak028p4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
