\par\par \b \uc2  Israel/Shekel -2: Down More Than 12% Vs Dlr In Oct \b0\par\par\uc2 376 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 1998\par 16:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JERUSALEM (Dow Jones)--The Israeli shekel (ILS) hit a record low against the dollar late Tuesday at the Bank of Israel fixing, when the exchange rate was set at ILS4.3160 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The shekel has weakened 1.9% compared to Monday's fixing at ILS4.2370 and 12.2% since the end of September. The shekel traded within a range of ILS4.2340 to ILS4.3400 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Trading was light and volumes low, which deepened the impact of dominant dollar buying, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. Foreign banks were active in the market closer to the 1330 GMT fixing, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  At the same time, dollar sales were few, as customers wait to see whether the Bank of Israel will raise the November 9.5% discount rate when it announces the key lending rate on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Market estimates place the rise between 50 to 150 basis points, with many dealers saying an increase of less than one percentage point won't affect the market. \par \par \uc2  Criticism was voiced in trading rooms over the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel\b0 \highlight\uc2 's pledge not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in trading to bolster the shekel. The statements have added anxiety to the market as the depreciation swells prices and sparks fears of an inflationary spiral. \par \par \uc2  "I think it's strange that the heads of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are stating they won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," said one dealer. "It's a tool that central banks worldwide use from time to time - not just when there is a crisis but also when there is an exaggerated movement in the market." \par \par \uc2  Inflation estimates for 1998 now reach as high as 8.0%, compared to a 4.0% to 5.0% forecast held through the end of August. \par \par \uc2  Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has raised interest rates as a way of taming inflation, "to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the discount rate this time is a mistake. Chances are it won't affect dollar buying. If they want to control the exchange rate, it should be through market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," another dealer said, on condition of anonymity. \par \par \uc2  -By Michele Gershberg;9722-537-6985;mgershberg@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1420GMT \par \par \uc2  1092 1849 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duak00ahn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
